  "name": "Char Grilled Snapper with an a Avocado, Mango, Prawn and Chilli Salsa",
  "text": "Char Grilled Snapper with an a Avocado, Mango, Prawn and Chilli Salsa\n\nPreparation time: 15 minutes\n\nCooking time: 8 minutes\n\nYield: 2\n\nIngredients\n\n2 fillets of snapper,\n\nextra virgin olive oil,\n\ncoriander sprigs (to garnish).\n\nFor the salsa\n\n1 deseeded and thinly sliced chilli,\n\n50 g thickly sliced cooked tiger prawns,\n\n2 thinly sliced spring onions,\n\n1/2 finely chopped garlic clove,\n\n1/2 peeled and diced avocado,\n\n1/4 peeled and diced mango,\n\njuice of 1/2 lime.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Mix all the salsa ingredients together.\n\n2. Halve the fillets diagonally, brush with oil, season, and grill.\n\n3. Spoon the salsa on the plates and lay the fish on top. Garnish with the coriander.",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
